    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ah, you scoundrel! Hurry up and study your lessons!&quot; said the parents and put you under house arrest. Try to outsmart your parents and find a way to hang out with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the role of a schoolchild whom the parents punished for a bad grade at school, and try to escape from home without being noticed by father and mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D first-person game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth, hiding, don't get caught, and don't make noise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, solve riddles, find items to plan your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, parents may notice open cabinets and doors.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ah, you scoundrel! Hurry up and study your lessons!&quot; said the parents and put you under house arrest. Try to outsmart your parents and find a way to hang out with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the role of a schoolchild whom the parents punished for a bad grade at school, and try to escape from home without being noticed by father and mother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D first-person game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth, hiding, don't get caught, and don't make noise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, solve riddles, find items to plan your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, parents may notice open cabinets and doors.</p></li></ul>",
